sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  title Admin creates a template
  participant U as Admin
  participant C as Admin Console
  participant A as Express API
  participant S as Supabase
  participant L as Activity Log
  U->>C: Fill template form + uploads
  C->>A: POST /api/admin/templates (multipart)
  A->>A: validateTemplate + withUploads
  A->>S: assertSlugAvailable(slug)
  S-->>A: slug free
  A->>S: templates.insert(payload)
  S-->>A: created row
  A->>S: syncTags(templateId, tags)
  A->>L: record template.created
  A-->>C: 201 template
  C-->>U: Show in template list
  Note over S: A duplicate slug is rejected with 409 before insert.
